title: 'test(collator-protocol): stabilize V3 scheduling-parent slot validation test'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Pins the active leaf header slot in `v3_advertisement_rejected_when_sp_not_last_finished_slot`
    via `slot_overrides` so V3 scheduling-parent validation does not flake when wall-clock crosses
    a relay slot boundary during the test.
crates:
- name: polkadot-collator-protocol
  bump: none